  "body": "It seems a bit surprising to me that we are not firing an event as we explicitly set the `paused` attribute to true. As a result, any code that only cares of whether a video is playing or paused would also need to listen to the `emptied` event to work around this silent state change.\r\n\r\n@whatwg/media would it make sense to change this?",
